Kyber-Weave
===========

Kyber-Weave's skill-governance feature originated as SkillForge, an MIT-licensed
project by the SkillForge contributors. That work was absorbed into this
repository and is now maintained here: Kyber-Weave owns the code, and there is
no upstream to track or contribute back to.

The MIT licence under which the absorbed work was received is retained in
LICENSE and continues to apply to it, including the original copyright notice:

